  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICTJ DRC 2011-2014                                Transitional Justice - ICTJ 2011-March 2014</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICTJ DRK 2011-2014                                &#xD6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till ICTJ (International Centre for Transitional Justice) i dess arbete att &#xF6;ka kunskap och kapacitet i fr&#xE5;ga om &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa bland enskilda organisationer i DRC, att opinionsbilda, och att st&#xF6;dja officiella och inofficiella initiativ inom omr&#xE5;det &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa. Forts&#xE4;ttning av insats 72600850.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to ICTJ (International Centre for Transitional Justice) in its work to build knowledge and capacity concerning transitional justice in civil society in the DRC, to promote public opinion, and to support official and non-official transitional justice initiatives. Continuation of contribution 72600850.</narrative>
  </description>
